{"code":200,"msg":"","succ":true,"news":{"nnid":2161,"appid":"dasai","programaId":20,"title":"关于举办第十八届蓝桥杯大赛 “主视觉与赛事IP文创设计”专项赛的通知","content":"<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: right;\" align=\"right\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: 'yes'; font-family: 仿宋; font-size: 14.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">蓝桥杯组委会字〔</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: 'yes'; font-family: 仿宋; font-size: 14.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">2026</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: 'yes'; font-family: 仿宋; font-size: 14.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">〕</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: 'yes'; font-family: 仿宋; font-size: 14.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">46</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: 'yes'; font-family: 仿宋; font-size: 14.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">号</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: none; text-align: center; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 22pt;\">关于举办第十八届蓝桥杯大赛</span></strong></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: none; text-align: center; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 22pt;\">&ldquo;主视觉与赛事IP文创设计&rdquo;专项赛</span></strong></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: none; text-align: center; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 22pt;\">的通知</span></strong></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: none; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: 'yes'; font-family: 仿宋; line-height: 150%; font-size: 14.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">各高等院校、参赛师生：</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 28.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: none; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: 'yes'; font-family: 仿宋; line-height: 150%; font-size: 14.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋;\">为进一步深化大赛品牌文化建设，挖掘当代青年的创意设计能力、视觉审美能力与文创产品开发创新能力，打造专属蓝桥杯的特色赛事文化</span>IP，赋能数字文创产业人才培养，经大赛组委会研究决定，举办第十八届蓝桥杯大赛&ldquo;主视觉与赛事IP文创设计&rdquo;专项赛</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: 'yes'; font-family: 仿宋; line-height: 150%; font-size: 14.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">，本赛项全程不收取任何参赛费用</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: 'yes'; font-family: 仿宋; line-height: 150%; font-size: 14.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">。现将该赛项相关参赛事宜正式通知如下：</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left: 0.0000pt; mso-para-margin-left: 0.0000gd; text-indent: 28.3500pt; mso-char-indent-count: 0.0000; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: none; mso-outline-level: 1; line-height: 150%; mso-list: l6 level1 lfo1;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-family: 黑体; font-size: 16.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">一、</span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"mso-spacerun: 'yes'; font-family: 黑体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 16.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">组织机构</span></span></p>\n<table class=\"MsoTableGrid\" style=\"margin-left: 13.35pt; border: medium none currentcolor;\" border=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\">\n<tbody>\n<tr style=\"height: 31.2000pt;\">\n<td style=\"width: 116px; padding: 0pt; border: medium none currentcolor;\" valign=\"top\">\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋; font-size: 14.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">&nbsp; 指导单位：</span></span></p>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width: 407px; padding: 0pt; border: medium none currentcolor;\" valign=\"top\">\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋; font-size: 14.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">中国软件行业协会</span></span></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 31.2000pt;\">\n<td style=\"width: 116px; padding: 0pt; border: medium none currentcolor;\" valign=\"top\">\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋; font-size: 14.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">&nbsp; 主办单位：</span></span></p>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width: 407px; padding: 0pt; border: medium none currentcolor;\" valign=\"top\">\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋; font-size: 14.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">蓝桥杯全国大学生软件和信息技术大赛组委会</span></span></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 31.2000pt;\">\n<td style=\"width: 116px; padding: 0pt; border: medium none currentcolor;\" valign=\"top\">\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋; font-size: 14.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">&nbsp; 承办单位</span><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋; font-size: 14.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">：</span></span></p>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width: 407px; padding: 0pt; border: medium none currentcolor;\" valign=\"top\">\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋; font-size: 14.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">国信蓝桥教育科技股份有限公司</span></span></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left: 0.0000pt; mso-para-margin-left: 0.0000gd; text-indent: 28.3500pt; mso-char-indent-count: 0.0000; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: none; mso-outline-level: 1; line-height: 150%; mso-list: l6 level1 lfo1;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-family: 黑体; font-size: 16.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">二、</span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"mso-spacerun: 'yes'; font-family: 黑体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 16.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">赛项安排</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left: 0.0000pt; mso-para-margin-left: 0.0000gd; text-indent: 19.4500pt; mso-char-indent-count: 0.0000; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: none; mso-outline-level: 1; line-height: 150%; mso-list: l3 level1 lfo2;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-family: 黑体; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: 15.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">（一）</span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"mso-spacerun: 'yes'; font-family: 黑体; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; line-height: 150%; font-size: 15.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">赛道及命题</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left: 42.2500pt; mso-para-margin-left: 0.0000gd; text-indent: -13.3500pt; mso-char-indent-count: 0.0000; mso-list: l4 level1 lfo3;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋; font-size: 14.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">(1)</span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"mso-spacerun: 'yes'; font-family: 仿宋; font-size: 14.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">&ldquo;蓝桥杯大赛&rdquo;主视觉创意设计</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 28.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: none; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: 'yes'; font-family: 仿宋; line-height: 150%; font-size: 14.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋;\">围绕</span><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋;\">&ldquo;巅峰18&middot;竞无止境&rdquo;主题基调，立足蓝桥杯大赛青年创新、实干进取、敢想敢创的精神内核，进行主视觉体系创意设计。选手可基于&ldquo;巅峰18&middot;竞无止境&rdquo;基调自由延伸解读，可诠释奋斗逐梦、创意迸发、科技人文融合、青年活力等多元方向，产出适配蓝桥杯大赛的整套主视觉方案。</span></span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left: 42.2500pt; mso-para-margin-left: 0.0000gd; text-indent: -13.3500pt; mso-char-indent-count: 0.0000; mso-list: l4 level1 lfo3;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋; font-size: 14.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">(2)</span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"mso-spacerun: 'yes'; font-family: 仿宋; font-size: 14.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">&ldquo;蓝桥杯大赛&rdquo;赛事IP文创设计</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 28.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: none; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: 'yes'; font-family: 仿宋; line-height: 150%; font-size: 14.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋;\">本赛道要求以骆驼为原型，全新原创赛事</span><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋;\">IP形象（IP形象命名为蓝驼驼），并基于IP形象进行文创设计。创作风格、形式不限，所有设计内容均需兼顾创意性与实际落地实用性。</span></span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 28.1000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: none; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋; line-height: 150%; font-size: 14pt;\">&ldquo;骆驼&rdquo;的特性：</span></strong></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left: 0.0000pt; mso-para-margin-left: 0.0000gd; text-indent: 28.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: none; line-height: 150%; mso-list: l8 level1 lfo4;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋; mso-font-width: 33%; font-size: 14.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">①　</span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"mso-spacerun: 'yes'; font-family: 仿宋; line-height: 150%; font-size: 14.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">坚持：骆驼以耐力横渡荒漠，竞赛成长亦是如此。无论是选手日复一日刷题攻坚，还是赛事多年坚守科创育人，摒弃急功近利，以长期坚持对抗困难与起伏。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left: 0.0000pt; mso-para-margin-left: 0.0000gd; text-indent: 28.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: none; line-height: 150%; mso-list: l8 level1 lfo4;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋; mso-font-width: 33%; font-size: 14.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">②　</span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"mso-spacerun: 'yes'; font-family: 仿宋; line-height: 150%; font-size: 14.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">专注：骆驼明晰前行方向，不为荒漠幻象所迷惑。蓝桥杯聚焦人才选拔的核心赛道，不追逐浮华热点，深耕选手实践能力评价，守住竞赛初心。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left: 0.0000pt; mso-para-margin-left: 0.0000gd; text-indent: 28.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: none; line-height: 150%; mso-list: l8 level1 lfo4;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋; mso-font-width: 33%; font-size: 14.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">③　</span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"mso-spacerun: 'yes'; font-family: 仿宋; line-height: 150%; font-size: 14.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">勤奋：骆驼的前进，源于一步一步实地跋涉。蓝桥杯倡导以赛促学，鼓励选手们实战历练，赛事深入高校一线，贴近师生真实需求，发掘真正有实力的青年人才。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 28.1000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: none;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋; font-size: 14pt;\">相关创作规范、提交规格等具体要求见附件。</span></strong></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left: 0.0000pt; mso-para-margin-left: 0.0000gd; text-indent: 19.4500pt; mso-char-indent-count: 0.0000; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: none; mso-outline-level: 1; line-height: 150%; mso-list: l3 level1 lfo2;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-family: 黑体; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: 15.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">（二）</span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"mso-spacerun: 'yes'; font-family: 黑体; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; line-height: 150%; font-size: 15.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">参赛对象</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 28.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: none; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: 'yes'; font-family: 仿宋; line-height: 150%; font-size: 14.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">具有正式全日制学籍并且符合相关报名要求的研究生、本科生</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: 'yes'; font-family: 仿宋; line-height: 150%; font-size: 14.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">和</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: 'yes'; font-family: 仿宋; line-height: 150%; font-size: 14.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">高职高专学生（以报名时状态为准）。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left: 0.0000pt; mso-para-margin-left: 0.0000gd; text-indent: 19.4500pt; mso-char-indent-count: 0.0000; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: none; mso-outline-level: 1; line-height: 150%; mso-list: l3 level1 lfo2;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-family: 黑体; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: 15.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">（三）</span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"mso-spacerun: 'yes'; font-family: 黑体; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; line-height: 150%; font-size: 15.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">报名及作品上传时间</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 28.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: none; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: 'yes'; font-family: 仿宋; line-height: 150%; font-size: 14.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">2026年9月8日14:00&mdash;2026年11月30日14:00</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left: 0.0000pt; mso-para-margin-left: 0.0000gd; text-indent: 19.4500pt; mso-char-indent-count: 0.0000; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: none; mso-outline-level: 1; line-height: 150%; mso-list: l3 level1 lfo2;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-family: 黑体; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: 15.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">（四）</span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"mso-spacerun: 'yes'; font-family: 黑体; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; line-height: 150%; font-size: 15.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">报名及作品提交方式</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 28.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: 'yes'; font-family: 仿宋; font-size: 14.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋;\">通过报名通道（</span><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋;\">https://dasai.lanqiao.cn）在线报名</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: 'yes'; font-family: 仿宋; font-size: 14.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">，</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: 'yes'; font-family: 仿宋; font-size: 14.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">并在报名系统中提交作品</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: 'yes'; font-family: 仿宋; font-size: 14.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left: 0.0000pt; mso-para-margin-left: 0.0000gd; text-indent: 19.4500pt; mso-char-indent-count: 0.0000; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: none; mso-outline-level: 1; line-height: 150%; mso-list: l3 level1 lfo2;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-family: 黑体; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: 15.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">（五）</span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"mso-spacerun: 'yes'; font-family: 黑体; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; line-height: 150%; font-size: 15.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">作品评审</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left: 0.0000pt; mso-para-margin-left: 0.0000gd; text-indent: 28.1000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: none; mso-outline-level: 2; line-height: 150%; mso-list: l2 level1 lfo5;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-weight: bold; font-size: 14.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">1.</span><!--[endif]--><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 14pt;\">评审程序</span></strong></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 28.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: 'yes'; font-family: 仿宋; font-size: 14.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋;\">参赛作品最终成绩采用加权计分模式：总成绩</span><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋;\">=专家评审得分&times;80%+历届参赛选手投票得分&times;20%。</span></span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 28.1000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋; font-size: 14pt;\">专家评审</span></strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: 'yes'; font-family: 仿宋; font-size: 14.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋;\">：组委会组建专家评审组，全程依据全国专家组制定的统一评分标准与考核细则，执行</span><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋;\">&ldquo;多维度交叉评审 + 分级复核&rdquo;制度，保障评审过程客观、结果公正、体系权威。</span></span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 28.1000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋; font-size: 14pt;\">选手投票</span></strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: 'yes'; font-family: 仿宋; font-size: 14.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">：投票权限仅限历届蓝桥杯各赛项参赛选手，通过蓝小圈小程序完成投票，投票数据将标准化换算为投票维度分值，与专家评审分数加权后，生成作品最终评审成绩。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left: 0.0000pt; mso-para-margin-left: 0.0000gd; text-indent: 28.1000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: none; mso-outline-level: 2; line-height: 150%; mso-list: l2 level1 lfo5;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-weight: bold; font-size: 14.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">2.</span><!--[endif]--><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 14pt;\">评审时间</span></strong></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left: 28.9000pt; mso-para-margin-left: 0.0000gd;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: 'yes'; font-family: 仿宋; font-size: 14.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">202</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: 'yes'; font-family: 仿宋; font-size: 14.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">6</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: 'yes'; font-family: 仿宋; font-size: 14.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋;\">年</span><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋;\">12月1日</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: 'yes'; font-family: 仿宋; font-size: 14.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">&mdash;202</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: 'yes'; font-family: 仿宋; font-size: 14.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">6</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: 'yes'; font-family: 仿宋; font-size: 14.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">年</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: 'yes'; font-family: 仿宋; font-size: 14.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">12</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: 'yes'; font-family: 仿宋; font-size: 14.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">月</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: 'yes'; font-family: 仿宋; font-size: 14.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">17</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: 'yes'; font-family: 仿宋; font-size: 14.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">日</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left: 0.0000pt; mso-para-margin-left: 0.0000gd; text-indent: 28.1000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: none; mso-outline-level: 2; line-height: 150%; mso-list: l2 level1 lfo5;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-weight: bold; font-size: 14.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">3.</span><!--[endif]--><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 14pt;\">评审规则</span></strong></span></p>\n<div align=\"center\">\n<table class=\"MsoTableGrid\" style=\"width: 100%; border: medium none currentcolor;\" border=\"1\" cellspacing=\"0\">\n<tbody>\n<tr style=\"height: 28.3500pt;\">\n<td style=\"width: 100.0000%; padding: 0.0000pt 5.4000pt 0.0000pt 5.4000pt; mso-border-left-alt: 0.5000pt solid #c00000; mso-border-right-alt: 0.5000pt solid #c00000; mso-border-top-alt: 0.5000pt solid #c00000; mso-border-bottom-alt: 0.5000pt solid #c00000; border: 1.0000pt solid #c00000;\" valign=\"center\" width=\"100.0000%\">\n<p class=\"15\" style=\"mso-pagination: widow-orphan; text-align: center;\" align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋; font-size: 10.5pt;\">评审规则</span></strong></span></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 100.0000%; padding: 0.0000pt 5.4000pt 0.0000pt 5.4000pt; border-left: 1.0000pt solid #c00000; mso-border-left-alt: 0.5000pt solid #c00000; border-right: 1.0000pt solid #c00000; mso-border-right-alt: 0.5000pt solid #c00000; border-top: none; mso-border-top-alt: 0.5000pt solid #c00000; border-bottom: 1.0000pt solid #c00000; mso-border-bottom-alt: 0.5000pt solid #c00000;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"100.0000%\">\n<p class=\"15\" style=\"mso-pagination: widow-orphan; line-height: 200%;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋; font-size: 10.5pt;\">1.</span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋; font-size: 10.5pt;\">切题性（</span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋; font-size: 10.5pt;\">20%</span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋; font-size: 10.5pt;\">）</span></strong></span></p>\n<p class=\"15\" style=\"mso-pagination: widow-orphan; line-height: 200%;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋; font-size: 10.5pt;\">作品的概念灵感必须紧扣命题方向，深入理解主题及所蕴含的文化内涵与设计理念。</span></span></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 18.0500pt;\">\n<td style=\"width: 100.0000%; padding: 0.0000pt 5.4000pt 0.0000pt 5.4000pt; border-left: 1.0000pt solid #c00000; mso-border-left-alt: 0.5000pt solid #c00000; border-right: 1.0000pt solid #c00000; mso-border-right-alt: 0.5000pt solid #c00000; border-top: none; mso-border-top-alt: 0.5000pt solid #c00000; border-bottom: 1.0000pt solid #c00000; mso-border-bottom-alt: 0.5000pt solid #c00000;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"100.0000%\">\n<p class=\"15\" style=\"mso-pagination: widow-orphan; line-height: 200%;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋; font-size: 10.5pt;\">2.</span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋; font-size: 10.5pt;\">艺术性（</span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋; font-size: 10.5pt;\">20%</span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋; font-size: 10.5pt;\">）</span></strong></span></p>\n<p class=\"15\" style=\"mso-pagination: widow-orphan; line-height: 200%;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋; font-size: 10.5pt;\">具有一定的审美价值并充分表达作品的概念与特色，不必拘泥于一种特定的艺术形式，但要求注重整体的美感统一。</span></span></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 100.0000%; padding: 0.0000pt 5.4000pt 0.0000pt 5.4000pt; border-left: 1.0000pt solid #c00000; mso-border-left-alt: 0.5000pt solid #c00000; border-right: 1.0000pt solid #c00000; mso-border-right-alt: 0.5000pt solid #c00000; border-top: none; mso-border-top-alt: 0.5000pt solid #c00000; border-bottom: 1.0000pt solid #c00000; mso-border-bottom-alt: 0.5000pt solid #c00000;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"100.0000%\">\n<p class=\"15\" style=\"mso-pagination: widow-orphan; line-height: 200%;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋; font-size: 10.5pt;\">3.</span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋; font-size: 10.5pt;\">完整性（</span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋; font-size: 10.5pt;\">20%</span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋; font-size: 10.5pt;\">）</span></strong></span></p>\n<p class=\"15\" style=\"mso-pagination: widow-orphan; line-height: 200%;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋; font-size: 10.5pt;\">内容传达到位，能够准确表达出完整的设计意图，具备阐释其思想内涵的完整度。</span></span></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 100.0000%; padding: 0.0000pt 5.4000pt 0.0000pt 5.4000pt; border-left: 1.0000pt solid #c00000; mso-border-left-alt: 0.5000pt solid #c00000; border-right: 1.0000pt solid #c00000; mso-border-right-alt: 0.5000pt solid #c00000; border-top: none; mso-border-top-alt: 0.5000pt solid #c00000; border-bottom: 1.0000pt solid #c00000; mso-border-bottom-alt: 0.5000pt solid #c00000;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"100.0000%\">\n<p class=\"15\" style=\"mso-pagination: widow-orphan; line-height: 200%;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋; font-size: 10.5pt;\">4.</span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋; font-size: 10.5pt;\">创新性（</span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋; font-size: 10.5pt;\">30%</span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋; font-size: 10.5pt;\">）</span></strong></span></p>\n<p class=\"15\" style=\"mso-pagination: widow-orphan; line-height: 200%;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋; font-size: 10.5pt;\">内容具有较强的创新性，立意新颖，构思巧妙，表现手法独到，创作理念独特，极具启发性，能够引人深思。</span></span></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 100.0000%; padding: 0.0000pt 5.4000pt 0.0000pt 5.4000pt; border-left: 1.0000pt solid #c00000; mso-border-left-alt: 0.5000pt solid #c00000; border-right: 1.0000pt solid #c00000; mso-border-right-alt: 0.5000pt solid #c00000; border-top: none; mso-border-top-alt: 0.5000pt solid #c00000; border-bottom: 1.0000pt solid #c00000; mso-border-bottom-alt: 0.5000pt solid #c00000;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"100.0000%\">\n<p class=\"15\" style=\"mso-pagination: widow-orphan; line-height: 200%;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋; font-size: 10.5pt;\">5.</span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋; font-size: 10.5pt;\">应用性（</span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋; font-size: 10.5pt;\">10%</span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋; font-size: 10.5pt;\">）</span></strong></span></p>\n<p class=\"15\" style=\"mso-pagination: widow-orphan; line-height: 200%;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋; font-size: 10.5pt;\">作品具有实用价值、感染力和传播力，能够充分体现设计融入日常生活之用的理念，容易打动受众。</span></span></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</div>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left: 0.0000pt; mso-para-margin-left: 0.0000gd; text-indent: 19.4500pt; mso-char-indent-count: 0.0000; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: none; mso-outline-level: 1; line-height: 150%; mso-list: l3 level1 lfo2;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-family: 黑体; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: 15.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">（六）</span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"mso-spacerun: 'yes'; font-family: 黑体; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; line-height: 150%; font-size: 15.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">拟获奖名单公示</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 28.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: none; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: 'yes'; font-family: 仿宋; line-height: 150%; font-size: 14.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋;\">为确保大赛秉承公平、公正、公开的原则，大赛组委会将对拟获奖名单进行统一公示，公示期</span><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋;\">3天。在奖项公示期内，参赛团队若对奖项有异议，可向组委会提出复核申请。</span></span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left: 0.0000pt; mso-para-margin-left: 0.0000gd; text-indent: 28.3500pt; mso-char-indent-count: 0.0000; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: none; mso-outline-level: 1; line-height: 150%; mso-list: l6 level1 lfo1;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-family: 黑体; font-size: 16.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">三、</span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"mso-spacerun: 'yes'; font-family: 黑体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 16.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">奖项设置及评选办法</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left: 0.0000pt; mso-para-margin-left: 0.0000gd; text-indent: 19.4500pt; mso-char-indent-count: 0.0000; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: none; mso-outline-level: 1; line-height: 150%; mso-list: l9 level1 lfo6;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-family: 黑体; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: 15.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">（一）</span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"mso-spacerun: 'yes'; font-family: 黑体; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; line-height: 150%; font-size: 15.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">获奖比例</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 28.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: 'yes'; font-family: 仿宋; font-size: 14.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">本</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: 'yes'; font-family: 仿宋; font-size: 14.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">赛项各赛道</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: 'yes'; font-family: 仿宋; font-size: 14.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">设置全国一、二、三等奖，</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: 'yes'; font-family: 仿宋; font-size: 14.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">原则上各赛项获奖比例为</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: 'yes'; font-family: 仿宋; font-size: 14.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">5%</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: 'yes'; font-family: 仿宋; font-size: 14.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">、</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: 'yes'; font-family: 仿宋; font-size: 14.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">10%</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: 'yes'; font-family: 仿宋; font-size: 14.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">、</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: 'yes'; font-family: 仿宋; font-size: 14.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">15%，总获奖比例不超过30%。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 28.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: 'yes'; font-family: 仿宋; font-size: 14.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">获奖比例仅作为参考</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: 'yes'; font-family: 仿宋; font-size: 14.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">，</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: 'yes'; font-family: 仿宋; font-size: 14.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">组委会将根据全国作品整体情况，制定</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: 'yes'; font-family: 仿宋; font-size: 14.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">各奖项</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: 'yes'; font-family: 仿宋; font-size: 14.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">获奖最低分数线，未达到获奖最低分数线者不得奖。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left: 0.0000pt; mso-para-margin-left: 0.0000gd; text-indent: 19.4500pt; mso-char-indent-count: 0.0000; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: none; mso-outline-level: 1; line-height: 150%; mso-list: l9 level1 lfo6;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-family: 黑体; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: 15.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">（二）</span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"mso-spacerun: 'yes'; font-family: 黑体; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; line-height: 150%; font-size: 15.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">奖项设置</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left: 0.0000pt; mso-para-margin-left: 0.0000gd; text-indent: 28.1000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: none; mso-outline-level: 2; line-height: 150%; mso-list: l5 level1 lfo7;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-weight: bold; font-size: 14.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">1.</span><!--[endif]--><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 14pt;\">参赛选手奖</span></strong></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 28.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: 'yes'; font-family: 仿宋; font-size: 14.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">获奖</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: 'yes'; font-family: 仿宋; font-size: 14.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">参赛团队</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: 'yes'; font-family: 仿宋; font-size: 14.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">选手可获得由</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: 'yes'; font-family: 仿宋; font-size: 14.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">蓝桥杯全国大学生软件和信息技术</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: 'yes'; font-family: 仿宋; font-size: 14.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">大赛组委会颁发的获奖证书。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 28.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: 'yes'; font-family: 仿宋; font-size: 14.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋;\">组委会将从两个赛道参赛作品中各遴选</span><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋;\">1件具备落地合作潜力的作品，遴选工作不受作品获奖名次限制。作品经组委会评估决定采用后，对应参赛团队可获得组委会支付的5000元知识产权转让对价，该作品知识产权转让的权利义务，详见附件相关约定。</span></span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left: 0.0000pt; mso-para-margin-left: 0.0000gd; text-indent: 28.1000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: none; mso-outline-level: 2; line-height: 150%; mso-list: l5 level1 lfo7;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-weight: bold; font-size: 14.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">2.</span><!--[endif]--><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 14pt;\">最受选手喜爱作品奖</span></strong></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 28.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: 'yes'; font-family: 仿宋; font-size: 14.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋;\">历届参赛选手投票得分最高的作品的参赛团队选手，将获得由蓝桥杯全国大学生软件和信息技术大赛组委会颁发的</span><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋;\">&ldquo;最受选手喜爱作品奖&rdquo;证书。</span></span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left: 0.0000pt; mso-para-margin-left: 0.0000gd; text-indent: 28.1000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: none; mso-outline-level: 2; line-height: 150%; mso-list: l5 level1 lfo7;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-weight: bold; font-size: 14.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">3.</span><!--[endif]--><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 14pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">指导教师奖</span> </span></strong></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 28.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: 'yes'; font-family: 仿宋; font-size: 14.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">获奖</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: 'yes'; font-family: 仿宋; font-size: 14.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">团队</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: 'yes'; font-family: 仿宋; font-size: 14.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">的指导教师将获得由</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: 'yes'; font-family: 仿宋; font-size: 14.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">蓝桥杯全国大学生软件和信息技术</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: 'yes'; font-family: 仿宋; font-size: 14.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">大赛组委会颁发的获奖证书。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left: 0.0000pt; mso-para-margin-left: 0.0000gd; text-indent: 28.1000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: none; mso-outline-level: 2; line-height: 150%; mso-list: l5 level1 lfo7;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-weight: bold; font-size: 14.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">4.</span><!--[endif]--><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 14pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">优秀组织个人奖</span> </span></strong></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 28.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: 'yes'; font-family: 仿宋; font-size: 14.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋;\">赛事报名和比赛组织工作表现突出、经审批符合相关条件的个人，将获得</span><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋;\">&ldquo;蓝桥杯全国大学生软件和信息技术大赛主视觉与赛事IP文创设计专项赛优秀组织个人&rdquo;称号。</span></span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left: 0.0000pt; mso-para-margin-left: 0.0000gd; text-indent: 28.1000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: none; mso-outline-level: 2; line-height: 150%; mso-list: l5 level1 lfo7;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-weight: bold; font-size: 14.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">5.</span><!--[endif]--><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 14pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">参赛学校奖</span> </span></strong></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 28.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: 'yes'; font-family: 仿宋; font-size: 14.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋;\">参赛组织工作成绩突出、经审批符合相关条件的单位，获</span><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋;\">&ldquo;蓝桥杯全国大学生软件和信息技术大赛主视觉与赛事IP文创设计专项赛优秀组织单位&rdquo;称号。</span></span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 28.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: 'yes'; font-family: 仿宋; font-size: 14.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋;\">参赛选手成绩优异、经审批符合相关条件的学校，获</span><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋;\">&ldquo;蓝桥杯全国大学生软件和信息技术大赛主视觉与赛事IP文创设计专项赛优胜学校&rdquo;称号。</span></span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left: 0.0000pt; mso-para-margin-left: 0.0000gd; text-indent: 28.3500pt; mso-char-indent-count: 0.0000; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: none; mso-outline-level: 1; line-height: 150%; mso-list: l6 level1 lfo1;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-family: 黑体; font-size: 16.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">四、</span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"mso-spacerun: 'yes'; font-family: 黑体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 16.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">参赛费用</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 28.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: none; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: 'yes'; font-family: 仿宋; line-height: 150%; font-size: 14.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">本赛项为免费赛</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: 'yes'; font-family: 仿宋; line-height: 150%; font-size: 14.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">项</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: 'yes'; font-family: 仿宋; line-height: 150%; font-size: 14.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">，</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: 'yes'; font-family: 仿宋; line-height: 150%; font-size: 14.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">全程不收取任何参赛费用</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: 'yes'; font-family: 仿宋; line-height: 150%; font-size: 14.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left: 0.0000pt; mso-para-margin-left: 0.0000gd; text-indent: 28.3500pt; mso-char-indent-count: 0.0000; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: none; mso-outline-level: 1; line-height: 150%; mso-list: l6 level1 lfo1;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-family: 黑体; font-size: 16.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">五、</span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"mso-spacerun: 'yes'; font-family: 黑体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 16.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">违纪作弊处罚</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left: 0.0000pt; mso-para-margin-left: 0.0000gd; text-indent: 19.4500pt; mso-char-indent-count: 0.0000; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: none; mso-outline-level: 1; line-height: 150%; mso-list: l7 level1 lfo8;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-family: 黑体; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: 15.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">（一）</span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"mso-spacerun: 'yes'; font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-fareast-font-family: 黑体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 15.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 黑体;\">违纪作弊行为定义</span></span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 28.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: none; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: 'yes'; font-family: 仿宋; line-height: 150%; font-size: 14.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">关于违纪作弊行为的定义，包括但不限于以下情形：</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left: 0.0000pt; mso-para-margin-left: 0.0000gd; text-indent: 28.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: none; line-height: 150%; mso-list: l1 level1 lfo9;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋; font-size: 14.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">1.</span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"mso-spacerun: 'yes'; font-family: 仿宋; line-height: 150%; font-size: 14.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">参赛作品非原创，存在抄袭、剽窃、盗用他人作品、购买作品等行为；</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left: 0.0000pt; mso-para-margin-left: 0.0000gd; text-indent: 28.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: none; line-height: 150%; mso-list: l1 level1 lfo9;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋; font-size: 14.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">2.</span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"mso-spacerun: 'yes'; font-family: 仿宋; line-height: 150%; font-size: 14.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">违反中华人民共和国相关法律法规，作品包含损害国家尊严、利益，泄露国家秘密；妨碍社会安定、损害公共利益；含有淫秽、色情、赌博、迷信、暴力等内容，存在民族、种族、宗教、性别歧视或损害未成年人和残疾人身心健康等违规元素。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left: 0.0000pt; mso-para-margin-left: 0.0000gd; text-indent: 19.4500pt; mso-char-indent-count: 0.0000; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: none; mso-outline-level: 1; line-height: 150%; mso-list: l7 level1 lfo8;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-family: 黑体; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: 15.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">（二）</span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"mso-spacerun: 'yes'; font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-fareast-font-family: 黑体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 15.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 黑体;\">违纪作弊处罚</span></span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left: 0.0000pt; mso-para-margin-left: 0.0000gd; text-indent: 28.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: none; line-height: 150%; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo10;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋; font-size: 14.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">1.</span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"mso-spacerun: 'yes'; font-family: 仿宋; line-height: 150%; font-size: 14.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">蓝桥杯大赛已建立不诚信名单库，凡在大赛中存在违纪作弊行为的选手，将被录入此库。库中人员不享有组委会与知名企业合作的就业绿色通道政策。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left: 0.0000pt; mso-para-margin-left: 0.0000gd; text-indent: 28.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: none; line-height: 150%; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo10;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋; font-size: 14.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">2.</span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"mso-spacerun: 'yes'; font-family: 仿宋; line-height: 150%; font-size: 14.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">凡在大赛中存在违纪作弊行为的选手，将在三年内被禁止参加蓝桥杯大赛任何赛项。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left: 0.0000pt; mso-para-margin-left: 0.0000gd; text-indent: 28.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: none; line-height: 150%; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo10;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋; font-size: 14.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">3.</span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"mso-spacerun: 'yes'; font-family: 仿宋; line-height: 150%; font-size: 14.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">若院校在组织比赛过程中出现严重违纪行为，经组委会核查确认后，组委会有权禁止该院校参加蓝桥杯任何赛事。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left: 0.0000pt; mso-para-margin-left: 0.0000gd; text-indent: 28.3500pt; mso-char-indent-count: 0.0000; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: none; mso-outline-level: 1; line-height: 150%; mso-list: l6 level1 lfo1;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-family: 黑体; font-size: 16.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">六、</span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"mso-spacerun: 'yes'; font-family: 黑体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 16.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">监督反馈</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 28.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: 'yes'; font-family: 仿宋; font-size: 14.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">详见《蓝桥杯全国大学生软件和信息技术大赛章程》。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left: 0.0000pt; mso-para-margin-left: 0.0000gd; text-indent: 28.3500pt; mso-char-indent-count: 0.0000; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: none; mso-outline-level: 1; line-height: 150%; mso-list: l6 level1 lfo1;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-family: 黑体; font-size: 16.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">七、</span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"mso-spacerun: 'yes'; font-family: 黑体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 16.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">其他</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 28.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: 'yes'; font-family: 仿宋; font-size: 14.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">大赛组委会拥有赛事最终解释权。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 28.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 28.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: 'yes'; font-family: 仿宋; font-size: 14.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\">附：</span><a href=\"https://x-static.lanqiao.cn/upload/202609/courseimg/7dc4aee6-5d26-4b07-a205-072e1edf8b3c.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">关于举办第十八届蓝桥杯大赛&ldquo;主视觉与赛事IP文创设计&rdquo;专项赛的通知.pdf</a></span></span></p>\n<p class=\"15\" style=\"text-indent: 28.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; line-height: 200%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋; line-height: 200%; font-size: 14pt; color: #000000;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p class=\"15\" style=\"text-indent: 28.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; text-align: right; line-height: 200%;\" align=\"right\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋; line-height: 200%; font-size: 14pt;\">蓝桥杯大赛组委会</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"15\" style=\"text-indent: 28.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; text-align: right; line-height: 200%;\" align=\"right\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋; line-height: 200%; font-size: 14pt;\">202</span><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋; line-height: 200%; font-size: 14pt;\">6</span><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋; line-height: 200%; font-size: 14pt;\">年</span><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋; line-height: 200%; font-size: 14pt;\">9</span><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋; line-height: 200%; font-size: 14pt;\">月</span><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋; line-height: 200%; font-size: 14pt;\">8</span><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋; line-height: 200%; font-size: 14pt;\">日</span></span></p>","img":"","creatTime":"2026-09-17T16:19:58","publishTime":"2026-09-08T00:00:00","nstatus":1,"author":"蓝桥杯大赛组委会","extdata":"[]","sort":1788816985840,"pv":1,"issync":0,"synopsis":"蓝桥杯组委会字〔2026〕46号\n\n关于举办第十八届蓝桥杯大赛\n“主视觉与赛事IP文创设计”专项赛\n的通知\n各高等院校、参赛师生：\n为进一步深化大赛品牌文化建设，挖掘当代青年的","istop":0}}